WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
Episode 26

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
Mother Earth, the Yamato is Back<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
( Air date: Mar 30, 1975 )

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.950
In September 2200...

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:24.240
...the space battleship Yamato is heading
back to save the people on Earth.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.950
A few days before, the Yamato had obtained
the radioactive contamination purifier...

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:31.240
...and was about to leave
planet Iscandar, when...

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.340
I love you...Mamoru.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:39.600
Starsha !

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.230
Brother !

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.360
Susumu, forgive me.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.200
Brother, take care !

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.490
Now it's time
for us to go.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:13.000
Kodai Susumu's brother, Mamoru,
fell in love with Starsha...

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.910
...and he decided to stay on
Iscandar to rebuild the civilization.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.460
The Yamato had to build
the purifier on board...

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.150
...to make up for the
delays they had encountered.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.400
Space Battleship

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.400
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.000
The Galactic System...

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.140
We're almost there.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.900
Hey, communications with
Earth have been reestablished.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.750
Is that the Yamato ?
This is Earth Headquarters.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.380
Did you obtain the radioactive
contamination purifier ?

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.750
This is Yamato.
This is Yamato.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.500
The assembly of the Cosmo
Cleaner is almost complete.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:20.250
Thank goodness. The Earth will
be saved at the last moment.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.090
What happened
to Captain Okita ?

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:26.430
Well, his space radiation
sickness has progressed...

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.960
And what happened ?

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:30.080
Commander, Commander !

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.350
The transmission got worse.
I'm adjusting.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:35.980
The transmission from
Earth is probably unstable.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.380
And they must be running
out of energy, too.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.520
I'll bring you some
medicine in 8 hours.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.660
Dr. Sado...

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:56.450
They say the human soul
leaves the body when you die.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.260
Do you believe that ?

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.990
Don't talk
like that, Captain.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.800
It's alright, Dr. Sado.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:07.700
I know everything
about my body.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:14.410
But I won't die until
I see Earth again.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.610
Captain.

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:22.260
I wonder where my soul will go,
after it separates from my body.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.500
It's definitely the Galactic System.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.800
This planetary debris is the proof 
of having so many planets.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.870
Alright. As soon as we've
passed through these, we'll warp.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:51.650
Desler Cannon

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.700
Prepare to fire
the Desler Cannon.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.450
Desler Cannon
is ready to fire.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.570
Yamato, be afraid of Desler.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.610
He's Desler,
the leader of Gamilus.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:26.360
{SHIKASHI}But he was supposed to have died in the
battle against the Yamato on planet Gamilus.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.100
Fire the Desler Cannon.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.040
What happened ?

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.350
We barely missed the
Yamato because it entered warp.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.370
Follow it.
We'll warp, too.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.560
But it'll take a while to
find the course of the Yamato.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.000
Just enter warp !

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.410
The warp is complete.
We're in the Solar System.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.310
Hey, look at that !

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:50.450
That's...

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.800
What happened ?

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.780
Both of our ship's destination
coordinates must have matched.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.180
We crashed into the
hull of the Yamato.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:17.800
We should've analyzed
their destination first, but...

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:23.200
What're you muttering about ?
Prepare a boarding party.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.100
We'll board the Yamato and fight
in hand to hand combat.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.100
Inject radioactive gas,
and charge in.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:37.840
Are you alright ?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:39.800
What's that ?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.370
Everyone, put on your masks.
It's poison gas.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:11.880
Kodai, this is the engine room.
Gamilus soldiers have boarded.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.640
Kato, Nanbu,
come with me !

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:15.050
Right !

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:36.180
Kodai.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.050
Hide somewhere, Yuki !

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:52.950
Mr. Tokugawa...

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.900
It's the gas.
You'll die without a helmet.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.020
Resistance is futile, kid.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.310
What ?

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:02.050
Where's the captain, kid ?

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:05.750
The Captain is sick, and
I'm Sub-Captain Kodai.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.850
Who are you ?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.030
What a spunky boy.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:14.970
I'm Desler,
the leader of Gamilus.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.220
Desler ?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.200
You thought I was dead ?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.770
I live, so Gamilus lives.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:26.720
{WAGA}You've fought well against great
Gamilus, young captain.  I praise you.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.460
{SHIKASHI}But the game isn't over yet.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.290
What the...?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.520
This is radioactive gas.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:36.430
Once the Yamato is filled with it,
it'll be just the same as the red Earth.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.650
It doesn't affect us...

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:42.330
...but I believe Earthlings can't
survive the radiation, am I right ?

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:44.270
Damn you.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.550
Emergency !

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.550
Radioactive poisonous gas is
spreading throughout the ship !

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.220
All hands, put
on your helmets !

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:53.940
Kodai.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.000
Hey, Yuki, what're
you going to do ?

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:14.750
Soon, the radioactive gas from the engine
room will spread throughout the ship...

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:15.550
...so I have to use this !

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.610
Yuki, don't !

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:25.450
Yuki, stop.
It's not even tested !

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.650
Why don't we do it now ?

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:28.400
Yuki.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.080
Yuki, it's the gas !
You have to get out now !

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.230
But Kodai...

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.230
Kodai will die !

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.750
Yuki, after pushing
the main AZ button...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.260
...watch until the activation plasma
oscillation is positive. Got that ?

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.650
Ninty-nine plus 25. Activation
plasma has started spinning.

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.650
Minus 3 degrees, activating !

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.610
Yuki...

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:22.550
You did it !
The radioactive gas is gone !

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:23.850
It's a success !

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.550
Yuki...?!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:33.500
Yuki !

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.310
Yuki !

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.770
What's going on ? The radioactive
gas has been neutralized.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.200
Retreat.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:56.050
We have to wear space suits in an Earth
type environment, but that slows us down.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.670
Alright, we have a
change of plans.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.170
Kodai, you're safe.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:19.820
Yes, when the gas was getting near,
I found a spacesuit for emergency use.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:22.200
Kodai...

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.160
...Yuki died.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:31.460
The air was cleaned, but in
return, it claimed Yuki's life.

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:45.520
Yuki...

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:54.610
Yuki activated the radioactive
poison purifier to save your life.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:12:00.050
But a deadly gas was formed only for a
brief moment in the purification process.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:06.650
Yuki sacrificed her life to show the
flaw of the purifier, and I can fix that.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.850
Kodai, we can definitely
save the Earth.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:14.930
Yuki !

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.270
Please, tell me
what I should do.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:52.430
How can I live alone
on Earth without Yuki ?

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.410
Kodai...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.410
You think you're alone ?

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:06.160
On Earth, there are many people
who are waiting for the Yamato.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:12.900
{KIMI}You should have learned to love
many more people on this voyage.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.760
{SONNA}If you're like that,
Yuki would be sad.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:23.130
{KODAI}Kodai, I'm determined to stay
alive until I see Earth again.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.760
{SORE}Do you know why ?

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.250
{CHIKYUU}Because my heart is connected
to those of the people on Earth...

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.290
{CHIKYUU}...who are desperately waiting
for the return of the Yamato.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.600
Captain.

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:34.950
I understand...

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.150
I mean I feel
like I do.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:39.250
It's difficult, but
I'll try my best.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.570
Kodai...

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:58.830
It's Earth.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.670
Earth !
We can see Earth !

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.130
What...Earth ?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.300
Let's go see it !

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.000
We can see Earth !

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:09.670
We've gotta go see it !

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.120
Let's go to the
observatory room !

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.950
Yuki, let's go see
Earth together.

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:08.460
Yuki, do you remember
the day we first met ?

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:14.390
When I saw you at Earth Headquarters,
I didn't feel like you were a stranger.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:19.000
And I wished I could be
aboard the Yamato with you.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:25.300
Since then my feelings toward you
have grown stronger and stronger.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:30.460
But I couldn't tell you about it, because
I had my responsibilities on the Yamato.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:37.250
{Iscandar}When my brother decided to stay with
Starsha, I realized one thing for sure.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:42.380
{ningen}Love is the most important thing in
life, and everything begins from it.

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:47.110
{dakara}Once we got back to Earth safely,
I was going to tell you...

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.610
{iya}I was going to tell you I love you.
I had to let you know my feelings...

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.130
But...

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.560
Yuki, can you see it ?
It's Earth.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.920
It's our Earth.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.930
Yamato detected,
100,000 km ahead.

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:57.210
Good. Prepare
the Desler Cannon.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:57.860
Aye, sir.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.930
Damn Earthlings, take this.
I'm the one who wins in the end.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.610
Strong energy beam approaching !

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:20.660
It's the enemy's
Wave Motion Gun.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.210
Evasive maneuver !
Starboard full !

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.620
The energy is
10,000 km away !

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:33.340
We can't get away !

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.330
Got them !
Desler's ship exploded !

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.280
But how...?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.700
When I saw Gamilus' reflective
satellite cannon on Pluto...

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.050
...I secretly developed a dimensional
reflective magnetic coating.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.150
{DOUYARA}I guess it was useful.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.350
{SAA}The repairs to the
engine room are finished.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:31.050
{SAA}Shima, hurry up
and return to Earth.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:32.630
Destination, Earth.
All ahead full.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.030
Dr. Sado...

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:50.490
Yes ?

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:53.290
Could you leave me
alone for a moment ?

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.760
Dr. Sado...

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:07.870
Thank you.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.200
Earth...

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:50.620
Everything about
it is precious.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.050
Yuki, let's go
somewhere quiet.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.790
Kodai, what happened to me ?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:01.970
Yuki...

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.210
Kodai, you're alright !

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.000
Yuki...

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:06.700
Yuki !

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:08.610
I'm so glad.

00:23:53.700 --> 00:24:00.910
On September 6th, 2200, the
Yamato returned to Earth safely.

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.890
Space was calm, as if nothing had happened.

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:17.350
Note:
On September 1st, 2200, the Yamato reestablishes communications with Earth from just outside
the Galactic System.

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:17.350
Desler followed the Yamato for 122 days without ambushing it or even reorganizing his remaining fleet.

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:27.350
Note:
The deadline for this episode 26 was the end of February. Tiger production already started "Young Tokugawa Ieyasu", so the animating work was shared by the entire staff.

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:27.350
The voice dubbing took place on March 19,
and by the time episode 25 was aired on March 22, the animation staff in Sakuradai Studio was disbanded.

00:24:29.800 --> 00:24:36.800
A

00:24:29.800 --> 00:24:36.800
Thanks for watching !
